---
<Layout title="Rolfing, Somatic Experiencing & NeuroAffective Touch in Folsom | Ryan’s Rolfing" description="Book Rolfing Structural Integration, the Rolfing Ten Series, Somatic Experiencing, and NeuroAffective Touch with Ryan Caputi in Folsom, CA." schema={schema}>
  <section class="px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
   <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#c4924a]">
     Services
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 text-6xl leading-none md:text-8xl">
     Choose the right starting point.
    </h1>
   </div>
   <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-6xl gap-6 md:grid-cols-4">
    <article class="border-t border-[#c4924a] bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
     <h2 class="text-4xl">
      Individual Rolfing Sessions
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
      Try Rolfing, work on a particular issue, or receive maintenance to keep your body healthy and feeling good.
     </p>
    </article>
    <article class="border-t border-[#c4924a] bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
     <h2 class="text-4xl">
      Rolfing Ten Series
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
      For people who want to invest in their health and body in a big way — the pinnacle sequence of Rolfing Structural Integration.
     </p>
    </article>
    <article class="border-t border-[#c4924a] bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
     <h2 class="text-4xl">
      Somatic Experiencing
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
      For fight/flight, chronic stress, anxiety, depression, or trauma that you want to address through a body-oriented approach.
     </p>
    </article>
    <article class="border-t border-[#c4924a] bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
     <h2 class="text-4xl">
      NeuroAffective Touch
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
      For gentle, consent-based somatic touch focused on regulation, embodiment, developmental patterns, and relational repair.
     </p>
      </article>
    <article class="border-t border-[#c4924a] bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
     <h2 class="text-4xl">
      Craniosacral Therapy
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[#545454]/80">
      Light, quiet hands-on work alongside Rolfing and Somatic Experiencing. Ryan has completed Upledger Craniosacral Therapy Levels 1 and 2.
     </p>
     <a class="mt-6 inline-block text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#c4924a]" href="/craniosacral-therapy-folsom/">
      Learn more
     </a>
    </article>
   </div>
   <!-- Pricing -->
   <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl">
     Pricing
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-1 text-xl">
     <p>
      <strong>
       Rolfing Session:
      </strong>
      $270
     </p>
     <p class="mt-1 text-[#545454]/80">
      No package deals available at this time.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-1 text-lg text-[#545454]/85">
      Rolfing sessions range from 60 to 90 minutes and end organically based on the goals for that day.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-4">
      <strong>
       Somatic Experiencing Session:
      </strong>
      $230
      <span class="text-base text-[#545454]/70">
       (50 minutes)
      </span>
     </p>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-3xl rounded-3xl bg-[#f8f6f2] p-7 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl">
     Ready to schedule?
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xl leading-8 text-[#545454]/85">
     Choose the session type that fits your goals and book online through Square.
    </p>
    <a class="mt-7 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#c4924a] px-8 py-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white hover:bg-[#9b7139]" href="https://rolfing-106793.square.site">
     Book online
    </a>
   </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
